8 gigs of GDDR6 memory.

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:26.653
So what are we losing when we downgrade to a feebler metal?

00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:32.425
Well, for starters, 29% of our CUDA cores, for the main cores, 33% fewer ray tracing

