00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:10.029
Spoiler alert, it doesn't.

00:02:10.029 --> 00:02:15.902
To prove it, we put the 4060 and its competition through a brutal series of tests, 1100 total

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:16.903
tests.

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:19.506
That's right, the labs is in full swing, baby!

