00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:34.821
So let's get these results out of the way quick.

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:42.462
The 4060 only touched 60 average FPS in F1, and was anywhere from meh to barely playable

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:43.830
