00:03:47.961 --> 00:03:53.800
more frames than the 4060, and at the time of writing can be purchased for just $10 more.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:59.772
In The Last of Us Part 1, the 4060 at least beats its direct Team Red competitor, RX 6700,

00:03:59.772 --> 00:04:02.775
