00:04:02.775 --> 00:04:06.412
And the more tests we ran, the more true our observations became.

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:10.183
This thing is so bad that if I didn't know any better, I'd say Nvidia didn't even

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:13.419
